# Requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
# Click "Send Request" above any ### block. Bodies come from ./requests/*.json,
# so this file and the JSON examples never drift apart.
# Change baseUrl to match your MCP_PORT.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List tools
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

< ./requests/tools_list.json

### List tools, continuing a trace (traceparent in _meta)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

< ./requests/tools_list_with_traceparent.json

### Search customers
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

< ./requests/search_customers.json

### Get ticket info
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

< ./requests/get_ticket_info.json

### Create ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

< ./requests/create_ticket.json

### Get ticket info, continuing an existing trace (traceparent in _meta)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

< ./requests/get_ticket_info_with_traceparent.json

### Error: ticket not found
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

< ./requests/error_ticket_not_found.json

### Error: customer not found
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

< ./requests/error_customer_not_found.json

### Error: malformed ticket id
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

< ./requests/error_invalid_ticket_id.json

### Error: invalid priority (rejected by the tool schema)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

< ./requests/error_invalid_priority.json
